  "description": "Decadence, rebuilt from the 1995 MIDI with real voices. The motif - a chord built a note at a time - is VPO's mixed choir with bowed violas under it; the rocking two-note chords are the mixed choir alone; the drone and the chromatic bass are VPO's male choir sung an octave up over Drift, the slow sub, which keeps the written D2. The melody is Halo doubled by Wire; the warm pad is VPO's full string section with Veil; the kit is the Salamander acoustic kit.",
